      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 1</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai46/renshuuC-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10001100001.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">もしもし、<ruby>木村<rp>(</rp><rt>きむら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。 <ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> いいですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">A lô. Kimura đây. Giờ nói chuyện được không?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">あ、<ruby>木村<rp>(</rp><rt>きむら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さん。 <ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> ①<u><ruby>会議<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まる</u> ところなんです。②<u><ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わった</u>ら、こちらから かけます。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">A, anh Kimura à. Bây giờ sắp vào họp. Sau khi kết thúc tôi gọi lại cho anh.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">わかりました。お<ruby>願<rp>(</rp><rt>ねが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いします。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tôi hiểu rồi. Nhờ anh nhé!</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>電車<rp>(</rp><rt>でんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>乗<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りました</p> <p> ② <ruby>東京駅<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょうえき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① お<ruby>客<rp>(</rp><rt>きゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんと <ruby>食事<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を して います</p> <p> ② <ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わります</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 2</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai46/renshuuC-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10001100010.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">①<u><ruby>大学<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></u>は どうですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Trường đại học thế nào?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>先月<rp>(</rp><rt>せんげつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> ②<u><ruby>授業<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まった</u> ばかりですから、まだ よく わかりません。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tháng trước vừa mới bắt đầu nên vẫn còn chưa biết rõ lắm.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">そうですか。<ruby>初<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めは <ruby>大変<rp>(</rp><rt>たいへん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かも しれませんが、<ruby>頑張<rp>(</rp><rt>がんば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って ください。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Thế à. Ban đầu thì có lẽ sẽ vất vả nhưng hãy cố lên.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">はい。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vâng.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>研究<rp>(</rp><rt>けんきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p> <p> ② <ruby>大学院<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがくいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい <ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p> <p> ② <ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めます</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 3</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai46/renshuuC-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10001100011.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">ミラーさん、<u>きょう <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</u>でしょうか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Anh Miller hôm nay chắc sẽ đến chứ?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">①<u><ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る</u> はずですよ。②<u>きのう <ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が ありました</u>から。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Chắc chắn sẽ đến mà. Vì hôm qua đã có điện thoại mà.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">じゃ、<ruby>大丈夫<rp>(</rp><rt>だいじょうぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですね。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vậy thì ổn rồi nhỉ.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>道<rp>(</rp><rt>みち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が わかります</p> <p> ② きのう <ruby>地図<rp>(</rp><rt>ちず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>渡<rp>(</rp><rt>わた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しました</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>一人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</